config MINISFORUM_PLATFORM
	tristate "Minisforum UM series platform and hardware monitoring driver"
	depends on ACPI_EC
	depends on DMI
	select ACPI_PLATFORM_PROFILE
	select HWMON
	help
	  Driver for the Minisforum UM series mini-PCs, whose thermal and
	  power controls are implemented by an ITE IT5571 Embedded
	  Controller.

	  Provides the ACPI platform profile interface and hardware monitoring
	  of board temperatures, fan speeds and PWM fan control.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called minisforum_platform.
